      "Sheriff's Office",
      "D. Brandenburg",
      "Establishing budget for 2026 HMA Grant",
      "The Sheriff's Office respectfully requests that the Board of Commissioners establish a budget for",
      "the previously approved $25,000 HMA/MDHHS grant for implementation of the Medication",
      "Assisted Treatment (MAT) program at the St. Joseph County Jail. The Sheriff's Office requests",
      "that grant revenue be increased by $25,000 and corresponding expenditure appropriations be",
      "increased by $25,000 within the Sheriff's Office/Jail budget to allow for the receipt and expenditure",
      "of these grant funds in accordance with the grant agreement.",
      "The MAT program is a medical program used to help inmates who have opioid or substance use",
      "disorders manage addiction safely and reduce the risk of overdose, withdrawal, relapse, and",
      "recidivism. One of the highest overdose-risk periods is immediately after release from jail because",
      "tolerance decreases during incarceration. MAT programs help reduce that risk significantly.",
      "The Sheriff's Office has entered into an agreement to work with Health Management Associates",
      "(HMA) to assist with the implementation of our MAT program. HMA is a vendor for MDHHS. This",
      "relationship qualifies the county to receive a $25,000 grant, which will be used for implementation",
      "of the MAT program.",
      "Budget Amendment Requested: Establish grant revenue in GL 101-351-569.000 in the amount of",
      "$25,000 and establish/increase expenditure appropriation in GL 101-351-760.000 in the amount",
      "of $25,000 for the HMA/MDHHS MAT Program Grant. This grant was previously accepted by the",
      "Board of Commissioners and requires no County matching funds. The budget amendment will",
      "provide the necessary appropriation authority to receive and expend the grant funds in",
      "accordance with the grant agreement.",
